      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image features a close-up of Caitlyn Jenner with a stern facial expression, overlaid with the text 'well split my dick and call me caitlyn.' This is a vulgar, mocking, and abusive meme that targets Caitlyn Jenner specifically, using crude language and a degrading metaphor to insult her. The intent is to ridicule her identity and gender transition, which falls under abusive content as it directly threatens and abuses an individual based on their personal identity and life choices. The meme leverages her public persona and the controversy surrounding her transition to deliver a hostile message, making it clearly abusive and harmful to her reputation and dignity.",
