      "label": "The text 'call me caitlyn' maps onto the visual entity Caitlyn_Jenner",
      "description": "The phrase 'call me caitlyn' in the text directly refers to the person depicted in the image, Caitlyn_Jenner. This creates an analogical mapping where the textual entity 'caitlyn' (as referenced in the text) is mapped onto the visual entity 'Caitlyn_Jenner'. The text is not merely describing her but is using her name to assert an identity that is being mocked, thereby creating a direct link between the name in the text and the person in the image. This mapping is reinforced by the spatial positioning of the text above her face, making the connection explicit.",
